# GENERATED FILE - DO NOT EDIT BY HAND.
#
# Regenerate from the repository root of glog-tools with:
#
#     ./gbuild.sh --env > images.env
#
# and copy it to glog-action/ unchanged. `tests/test_images_env.py` fails if
# either copy drifts from what gbuild.sh produces, so a stale file is caught in
# CI rather than by a scan that quietly runs last month's images.
#
# Each tag is glog-scan-<lang>-<first 4 hex of md5("<lang>-<tool>" + SALT)>.
# The keys name a stage, not a language: several languages run more than one
# engine, and which of them a given driver runs is that driver's decision.
#
# The GLOG_SCAN_IMAGE_ prefix is deliberate and is not the drivers' existing
# GLOG_IMAGE_<LANG> local-override variable: that one names a whole language's
# image and is set by a user, this one names one stage's registry tag and is
# generated. Keeping them visually distinct means neither can shadow the other.
